  "title": "主线程与阻塞",
  "concept": "JavaScript 在单线程上运行——当繁重任务阻塞主线程时，UI 会冻结。",
  "content": {
    "code": "const tasks = [];\nlet uiBlocked = false;\n\nfunction heavyTask(name) {\n  uiBlocked = true;\n  let result = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n    result += i;\n  }\n  tasks.push({ name: name, result: result });\n  uiBlocked = false;\n  return result;\n}\n\nconst result1 = heavyTask('Task A');\nconst result2 = heavyTask('Task B');\nconst total = result1 + result2;\n\nconsole.log(tasks);\nconsole.log(total);",
